      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "Paragraph (a) prohibitions do not apply to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is: (1) law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while performing duty at the airport; (2) an individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with 49 CFR 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562; or (3) an individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.",
