      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or baggage in an inaccessible cargo hold under 49 CFR 1562.23 any unloaded firearm(s) unless the passenger declares the unloaded firearm to the aircraft operator before checking the baggage, the firearm is unloaded, it is carried in a hard-sided container, and the container is locked with only the passenger retaining the key or combination.",
