 baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\\n\\n(1) Any loaded firearm(s).\\n\\n(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\\n\\n(3) Any unauthorized explosive or incendiary.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:11ebec03a3746dac9b72f8e9fe67ec3193040563c35ad4aba86a4a45c0049111\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"modality_quote\":\"may not\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:3352f0c31daca8b2d136f06d31413f25380752c59766bc44e251d8b866f8d76a\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(c) In checked baggage. A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\\n\\n(1) Any loaded firearm(s).\\n\\n(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\\n\\n(3) Any unauthorized explosive or incendiary.\",\"references\":[\"1562.23\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:8227a398848f5fe0bdde162725d638ffc73e05df0a2b63ddcb0a82b674d8c289\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(c) In checked baggage. A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or